  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 400°F (200°C).",
    "In a small bowl, mix together Anju, fres, gochugaru, honey, soy sauce, brown sugar, and black pepper.",
    "Cut the Fromage into 1-inch (2.5 cm) cubes.",
    "Place the Fromage cubes on a baking sheet lined with parchment paper.",
    "Brush the Fromage with sesame oil and sprinkle the Anju mixture evenly over the top.",
    "Roast in the preheated oven for 15-20 minutes, or until the Fromage is golden brown and caramelized.",
    "Remove from the oven and let cool for a few minutes before serving."
